#. module: delivery_label_cod_kh
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_label_cod_kh.field_res_company__kh_label_pay_url_template
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_label_cod_kh.field_res_config_settings__kh_label_pay_url_template
msgid ""
"URL encoded in the payment QR in 'Custom URL' mode. Placeholders (URL-"
"encoded): {order} sales order reference, {picking} transfer reference, "
"{amount} amount to collect, {currency} currency code (USD, KHR), {partner} "
"receiver name. Example: "
"https://pay.example.com/?ref={order}&amount={amount}&ccy={currency}"
msgstr ""

#. module: delivery_label_cod_kh
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:delivery_label_cod_kh.res_config_settings_view_form_cod_label
msgid ""
"Upload the QR code of the shop (ideally the square code itself, cropped from the ABA\n"
"                                    card): it is cropped to its ink and printed 18 mm wide, and the customer types the\n"
"                                    amount shown next to it."
msgstr ""

#. module: delivery_label_cod_kh
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_label_cod_kh.field_stock_picking__kh_cod_amount_auto
msgid ""
"What the 'Auto' mode prints: sales order total minus the paid part of its "
"posted invoices (credit notes deducted) and its online payments not "
"reconciled with them."
msgstr ""

#. module: delivery_label_cod_kh
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_label_cod_kh.field_res_company__kh_label_qr_content
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_label_cod_kh.field_res_config_settings__kh_label_qr_content
msgid ""
"What the information QR code of the label contains:\n"
"- Receiver location: Google Maps link built from the contact's geolocation (falls back to the transfer reference when the contact has no coordinates).\n"
"- Transfer reference: the reference of the transfer.\n"
"- Nothing: no information QR code."
msgstr ""

